Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, fuse3, xdg-utils, ca-certificates
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Breaks: tuxdrive (<< 0.4.4)
Replaces: tuxdrive (<< 0.4.4)
Homepage: https://github.com/tpluharik/Tuxdrive
Description: Google Drive and Microsoft OneDrive client for Ubuntu
 TuxDrive provides browser-based OAuth, automatic transfer-engine bootstrap,
 multiple cloud accounts, two-way and
 one-way synchronization, selective folders, conflict handling, tray controls,
 notifications, and files-on-demand virtual drives through rclone and FUSE.
